  +u32 mentionCount
  +u32 urgentCount
  +u32 topicCount
  +u32 memberCount
  +string[] memberLeaves
  +bool hasScheduledMessage
  +bool isTop
  +NotificationMode notificationMode
  +ChannelLifecycleVm lifecycle
  +u64 settingsVersion
  +string purpose
  +string header
  +ActionBinding[] actions
}

ComposerIntent --> ReplyInput
ComposerIntent --> AppCommand : JSON payload
AppCommand --> Tick : Tick.Command
Tick --> PendingSend : handle_send_message
PendingSend --> Effect : declares I/O
PendingSend --> CreatePostBody
CreatePostBody --> UserSnapshot
Effect --> LocalMessageRow : Persist then PortReply
LocalMessageRow --> TimelineWindowVm : authoritative readback
TimelineWindowVm *-- MessageVm
MessageVm *-- DeliveryVm
MessageVm *-- ActionBinding
TimelinePatch *-- ReplaceView
ReplaceView *-- TimelineWindowVm
SurfaceMutationV2 *-- TimelineScope
SurfaceMutationV2 *-- TimelinePatch
InteractionFrameV2 *-- InteractionRuntimeVm
InteractionFrameV2 *-- SurfaceMutationV2
InteractionFrameV2 *-- UiDirective
SurfaceRuntime --> InteractionFrameV2 : strict decode and stage
SurfaceRuntime *-- SurfaceSlotState
SurfaceRuntime --> FrameApplied : after atomic swap
ActionBinding --> ActionInvocationEnvelope : copied verbatim when invoked
ActionInvocationEnvelope *-- ActionInvocation
DialogListVm *-- DialogRowVm
DialogRowVm *-- ActionBinding

note for ComposerIntent "CURRENT G01 ingress is direct im_send_message.\nIt does not invoke an ActionBinding."
note for ActionBinding "The G01 timeline rows contain reply, forward, react,\nurgent, revoke, retry and other projected capabilities.\nThey act on an existing row, not on message creation."
note for DialogListVm "It is not inside the direct sending/sent replay.\nA later WS post may enter DialogPatchByPost and emit\nDialog plus paired Unread after channel write/read."
